; --- 38M: the Crossway toll, sold on both sides of the road --------------------
; These two flank the region portal, which GameBootstrap spawns at SpawnPoint + (0, -1.2, -4) = (0, 0, 1)
; — so a player walking out of the square meets the warden before they meet the gate. The Crossway Post
; itself is 38M2's cell; what has to exist today is somewhere to buy the papers the toll reads.
;
; ⚠️ They are TWO entities and must stay that way. EntityNode.GetComponent<T> returns the first child
; match, so a permit and a bribe hung on one body would leave the second one unreachable and silent —
; the 38E finding, which is also why neither of them carries a DialogueComponent.
